&reftitle.description;
public Io\Poll\BackendIo\Poll\Context::getBackend
Returns the backend that the context polls with. This is never Io\Poll\Backend::Auto: a context created with it reports the backend that was selected.

&reftitle.returnvalues;

 Returns the Io\Poll\Backend case of the backend in
 use.

  &reftitle.examples;

   Io\Poll\Context::getBackend example


<?php
use Io\Poll\Backend;
use Io\Poll\Context;

$context = new Context();
var_dump($context->getBackend());

$context = new Context(Backend::Poll);
var_dump($context->getBackend());


